      "sourceHash": "c6370406b900be636c920ca00a3cc1bd68a3454d51b33d77cbee52f86ea7ced9",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The following code shows how how you can create three shape layers using the dash patterns described above.",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet layer = CALayer()\n      \nlet lineDashPatterns: [[NSNumber]?]  = [nil, [2,3], [10, 5, 5, 5]]\n     \nfor (index, lineDashPattern) in lineDashPatterns.enumerated() {\n    \n    let shapeLayer = CAShapeLayer()\n    shapeLayer.strokeColor = UIColor.black.cgColor\n    shapeLayer.lineWidth = 5\n    shapeLayer.lineDashPattern = lineDashPattern\n    \n    let path = CGMutablePath()\n    let y = CGFloat(index * 50)\n    path.addLines(between: [CGPoint(x: 0, y: y),\n                            CGPoint(x: 640, y: y)])\n    \n    shapeLayer.path = path\n    \n    layer.addSublayer(shapeLayer)\n}\n```",
      "documentTitle": "lineDashPattern",
      "framework": "QuartzCore",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
